Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 4.1.19-rt22 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 4.1.19 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v4.1-rt
  Head SHA1: 9e8cb7ecfc7cdb31d6d9e524fb66524aab9ae997


Or to build 4.1.19-rt22 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-4.1.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-4.1.19.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/4.1/patch-4.1.19-rt22.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve
